cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Nordic Helleristninger Scientific Corpus & 750-Piece Figurative Jigsaw Release (v2026.W48)"
message: "If you use this scientific rock-art corpus, multi-layer SVG tracings, dual-trace QA dataset, or statistical findings, please cite this release and the underlying primary cultural heritage archives."
type: dataset
version: "v2026.W48"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
authors:
  - name: "Nordic Rock-Art Open Corpus & Formverk Research Team"
    affiliation: "jigsaw.iverfinne.no"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iverfinne/jigsaw.iverfinne.no"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - rock art
  - helleristninger
  - hällristningar
  - Scandinavian archaeology
  - veideristninger
  - jordbruksristninger
  - morphometrics
  - open heritage
  - SVG
  - dual-trace QA
abstract: >-
  Versioned weekly release (v2026.W48) of the open Nordic rock-art (helleristninger /
  hällristningar) scientific corpus, featuring provenance-verified archival sources,
  multi-layer SVG tracings (figures, cup_marks, cracks, uncertain, scale_bar),
  stratified independent dual-trace IoU quality assurance, reproducible morphometric
  and regional iconographic analyses, and the consolidated 750-piece commercial-hygiene
  wooden jigsaw production deliverables. Commercial licensing clearance remains pending
  institutional review; all primary archive attributions and license URLs are preserved
  per figure.
